          "citation": "{\"artifact_id\":\"src_6c895ee56c7a6b33aaeebe06d530eb4b\",\"end_char\":1029,\"quote\":\"Our fictional call log records Riley Foster's three heating-failure reports on 2025-02-01, 2025-02-08, 2025-02-17. Each report identified the same rented flat and recurrent stoppage of the fixed heating. We received the first report on2025-02-01; this is the landlord's first documented knowledge of the defect.\",\"sha256\":\"ae66233b1e2853056ced10f26ebe615adef8fb17bf18293a94b93a984825576c\",\"start_char\":718,\"text_sha256\":\"ae66233b1e2853056ced10f26ebe615adef8fb17bf18293a94b93a984825576c\"}"
